    <item>
      <title>Zimbabwe’s goat industry evolves with new standards</title>
      <link>https://www.farmersweekly.co.za/animals/sheep-and-goats/zimbabwes-goat-industry-evolves-with-new-standards/#utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=zimbabwes-goat-industry-evolves-with-new-standards</link>
      <description>Zimbabwe’s goat industry is steadily growing, moving towards a structured, traceable, breed-standard-driven system. Farmer, Sifiso Ndlovu Agbetorwoka discusses the industry’s progress, South African training programmes, and how her farm is helping to shape commercial goat production in Zimbabwe.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.farmersweekly.co.za/animals/sheep-and-goats/zimbabwes-goat-industry-evolves-with-new-standards/#utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=zimbabwes-goat-industry-evolves-with-new-standards</guid>
      <enclosure url="https://cax-wp-farmers-prod-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/app/uploads/2026/02/Goats.jpg" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/>
      <pubDate>Mon, 09 Feb 2026 13:00:35 +0000</pubDate>
    </item>
