      <title>FMD vaccine rollout criticised as industry questions years of inaction</title>
      <link>https://www.farmersweekly.co.za/agri-news/south-africa/fmd-vaccine-rollout-criticised-as-industry-questions-years-of-inaction/#utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=fmd-vaccine-rollout-criticised-as-industry-questions-years-of-inaction</link>
      <description>Government has hailed the Agricultural Research Council’s release of South Africa’s first locally produced foot-and-mouth disease vaccine on 6 February as a milestone, but industry experts say it is overdue and overlooks earlier opportunities to curb the escalating outbreak.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.farmersweekly.co.za/agri-news/south-africa/fmd-vaccine-rollout-criticised-as-industry-questions-years-of-inaction/#utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=fmd-vaccine-rollout-criticised-as-industry-questions-years-of-inaction</guid>
